OL,3,CJordan Pickford 'almost caused crash'
OL,4,Cwith careless driving in Lamborghini
OL,6,FEngland goalkeeper Jordan Pickford
OL,7,Fnearly caused a crash with two other
OL,8,Fcars during a bout of careless driving
OL,9,Fin his #200,000 Lamborghini supercar,
OL,10,Fa court has heard.
OL,12,FThe 32-year-old keeper was pulled over
OL,13,Fby police after ignoring a give way
OL,14,Fsign, forcing two cars to slam on the
OL,15,Fbrakes, and then speeding off into the
OL,16,Fdistance.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
