PN,36102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F361A1791381055
OL,3,CJordan Pickford 'almost caused crash'
OL,4,Cwith careless driving in Lamborghini
OL,6,FThe incident happened in the upmarket
OL,7,FCheshire town of Knutsford on April
OL,8,F14, sparking a criminal prosecution
OL,9,Ffor driving without due care or
OL,10,Fattention.
OL,12,FPickford, who has 336 appearances for
OL,13,FEverton and 92 England caps, has
OL,14,Fpleaded guilty to the charge and
OL,15,Frequested a court hearing to explain
OL,16,Fhis mitigation.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
