PN,36103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F361A1791381055
OL,3,CJordan Pickford 'almost caused crash'
OL,4,Cwith careless driving in Lamborghini
OL,6,FAccording to court documents, PC Cecil
OL,7,FRicardo, from Cheshire Police, said he
OL,8,Fhad just left the station when he saw
OL,9,FPickford's blue Lamborghini Urus
OL,10,Fcomplete with personalised number
OL,11,Fplates.
OL,13,F"I was stationary on Bexton Road,
OL,14,FKnutsford, waiting for traffic signals
OL,15,Fto turn green," he wrote.
OL,17,F"I then witnessed a blue Lamborghini
OL,18,FUrus driving along Princess Street.
OL,26,@uD@AOUwD@OO]yD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,362,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F361A1791381055
OL,3,CJordan Pickford 'almost caused crash'
OL,4,Cwith careless driving in Lamborghini
OL,6,F"It reached the junction with Toft
OL,7,FRoad, completely ignored the give way
OL,8,Flines and pulled onto Toft Road
OL,9,Fcausing two vehicles to slam on their
OL,10,Fbrakes to avoid a collision.
OL,12,F"The Lamborghini then sped down Toft
OL,13,FRoad, Knutsford."
OL,15,FPC Ricardo said he activated his
OL,16,Flights and siren to set off in pursuit
OL,17,Fof the Lamborghini, noticing he was
OL,18,Fdriving at 50mph while the Lamborghini
OL,19,F"was still pulling away".
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUuD@QO]{D@AOU{D@XO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
