OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,362,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F361A1791381055
OL,3,CJordan Pickford 'almost caused crash'
OL,4,Cwith careless driving in Lamborghini
OL,6,F"The speed limit on that stretch of
OL,7,FToft Road, Knutsford, is 30mph," he
OL,8,Fnoted.
OL,10,FThe officer said Pickford appeared to
OL,11,Fnotice the chasing police car and
OL,12,Fpulled over.
OL,14,FPickford pleaded guilty in writing in
OL,15,Fthe Single Justice Procedure and told
OL,16,FWarrington Magistrates Court: "I would
OL,17,Flike to attend court to put forward my
OL,18,Fmitigation."
OL,26,@nD@AOUoD@`O]xD@_OUzD@LO]
