OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,362,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F361A1791381055
OL,3,CJordan Pickford 'almost caused crash'
OL,4,Cwith careless driving in Lamborghini
OL,6,FHis case was formally adjourned last
OL,7,Fweek until a hearing at Chester
OL,8,FMagistrates' Court on December 7.
OL,10,FPickford, who started his career at
OL,11,FSunderland before loan spells at six
OL,12,Fclubs including Burton Albion,
OL,13,FBradford City and Preston North End,
OL,14,Fhas featured for England at the 2018,
OL,15,F2022 and 2026 World Cups, and was in
OL,16,Fgoal for the country's Euro 2020 and
OL,17,F2024 final appearances.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/6
